  "details": "Two features that i personally want added that is now no longer possible, \nWhen dropping a portal give you a laser pointer to select where the portal goes so you don't have to worry about being too close to spawn or player standing in your way\nAnd secondly world pre-download. someworlds/users take longer to download than others and being able to stay in your instance while you wait for the world to download makes moving as a group so much easier and causes less confusion because you're not wondering if your friend crashed or is still loading or whatever.\nPlease and thank you",
